(SITE CONDITIONS) Tj T*
(i\) Equipment is to be rated for a maximum ambient temperature of 40 ?.) Tj T*
(ii\) The relative humidity at site can go up to 95% \(percent\).) Tj T*
(iii\) The site is located at less than 1000 mtr above MSL.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART D — MAIN LT PANEL) Tj T*
(i\) The main LT switchboard shall comply with IS/IEC 61439-1:2020 and IS/IEC 61439-2:2020. The) Tj T*
(switchboard shall be of floor standing cubicle construction using CRCA sheet steel 2 m.m.) Tj T*
(thick.) Tj T*
(ii\) The switchboard shall have a rated operational voltage of 415 V AC, 3 phase 4 wire, 50) Tj T*
(cycles per second. The main busbar shall be electrolytic grade aluminium with a continuous) Tj T*
(rating of 1600 ampere.) Tj T*
(iii\) The short time withstand current of the busbars shall be 50 kA \(rms\) for one second.) Tj T*
(iv\) The panel enclosure is to have a degree of protection of IP54.) Tj T*
(v\) Internal separation of the switchboard shall be to Form 3b.) Tj T*
(vi\) Each incomer shall be a 1600 ampere, four pole, motorised air circuit breaker complying) Tj T*
(with IS/IEC 60947-2:2003. Outgoing feeders shall be controlled by MCCBs having an ultimate) Tj T*
(breaking capacity of 36 kA \(rms\).) Tj T*
(vii\) Each incomer shall be provided with a class 0.5 accuracy multifunction meter.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GUARANTEED TECHNICAL PARTICULARS — LT PANEL) Tj T*
(Rated operational voltage: 415 V AC) Tj T*
(Main busbar rated current: 1600 ampere) Tj T*
(Rated short-time withstand current: 50 kA \(rms\) for 1 s) Tj T*
(Enclosure degree of protection: IP54) Tj T*
(Make and type: \(to be furnished by the bidder\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
